 days previous to his assassination, he said: “I am going like a lamb to the slaughter; but I am calm as a summer’s morning; I have a conscience void of offense towards God, and towards all men. I shall die innocent, and it shall yet be said of me—he was murdered in cold blood.”—The same morning, after Hyrum had made ready to go—shall it be said to the slaughter? yes, for so it was—he read the following paragraph, near the close of the twelfth chapter of Ether, in the Book of Mormon, and turned down the leaf upon it:","n":4,"sm":"Ina ua alu atu Iosefa i Karefasi e tuu atu o ia lava i manaoga faatagāfai o le tulafono, i le lua po o le tolu aso a o lumanai ai lona tagatavaleina, sa saunoa mai o ia: “Ua ’ou alu atu e pei o se tamai mamoe e fasia; ae ua ’ou toafilemu e pei o se taeao o le tau mafanafana; ua ia te a’u se lotofuatiaifo ua aunoa ma se faatausuai e faasaga i le Atua, ma faasaga i tagata uma. O le a ’ou oti lē sala ma o le a faapea ona fai ane e uiga ia te a’u— sa fasiotia o ia ma le faufau i ai.”—I le taeao lava lea, ina ua uma ona sauni o Ailama e alu— e mafai ona tatou faapea ane i le fasiga? ioe, aua sa faapea lava— sa faitauina e ia le palakalafa lenei, e latalata i le faaiuga o le mataupu e sefululua o le tusi a Eteru, i le Tusi a Mamona, ma afe i lalo le itulau i ona luga:","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"when","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"alu"},{"en":"went","sm":"atu"},{"en":"Joseph","sm":"Iosefa"},{"en":"in","sm":"i"},{"en":"Carthage","sm":"Karefasi"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"tuu"},{"en":"to deliver","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"himself","sm":"lava"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"desire","sm":"manaoga"},{"en":"","sm":"faatagāfai"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of the law,","sm":"tulafono,"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"of the","sm":"le"},{"en":"two","sm":"lua"},{"en":"·","sm":"po"},{"en":"or","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"three","sm":"tolu"},{"en":"days","sm":"aso"},{"en":"of","sm":"a"},