halt be made strong, even unto the sitting down in the place which I have prepared in the mansions of my Father. And now I … bid farewell unto the Gentiles; yea, and also unto my brethren whom I love, until we shall meet before the judgment-seat of Christ, where all men shall know that my garments are not spotted with your blood. The testators are now dead, and their testament is in force.","n":5,"sm":"Ma sa oo ina ou tatalo atu i le Alii ina ia avatu e ia le alofa tunoa i Nuuese, ina ia latou maua le alofa mama. Ma sa oo ina fetalai mai le Alii ia te a’u: Afai e lē i ai ia te i latou le alofa mama, e lē afaina lea mea ia te oe, ua e faamaoni; o le mea lea, o le a faamamāina ou ofu. Ma ona ua e vaai i lou vaivai, o le a faamalosia ai oe, e oo lava i le nofo i lalo i le nofoaga ua Ou saunia i maota o lo’u Tamā. Ma o lenei ou te … faatofa atu i Nuuese; ioe, ma i o’u uso foi o e ua ou alofa i ai, seia oo ina tatou feiloai i luma o le nofoa-faamasino o Keriso, lea o le a iloa ai e tagata uma ua lē pisia o’u ofu i o outou toto. Ua maliliu nei le ’au molimau, ma ua tu nei la laua mau.","w":[{"en":"and","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"it came to pass that","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"tatalo"},{"en":"I prayed","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"to the Lord","sm":"Alii"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"to carried","sm":"avatu"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"he","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"not love","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"grace","sm":"tunoa"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"to the Gentiles,","sm":"Nuuese,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"latou"},{"en":"that they might have","sm":"maua"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"love","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"clean.","sm":"mama."},{"en":"and","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"it came to pass that","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"fetalai"},{"en":"said","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the Lord","sm