ry is their eternal reward. From age to age shall their names go down to posterity as gems for the sanctified.","n":6,"sm":"O Ailama Samita na fasefulu-fa tausaga o le matua ia Fepuari, 1844, ma o Iosefa Samita sa tolusefulu-valu ia Tesema, 1843; ma mai i le taimi ma le agai i luma o le a tusia o laua igoa i totonu o le ’au maturo o tapuaiga faalelotu; ma o le a faamanatuina i lē e faitau i atunuu uma, o le Tusi a Mamona, ma le tusi lenei o Mataupu Faavae ma Feagaiga o le ekalesia, na faatauina i toto e sili ona lelei o le seneturi sefuluiva, e aumai ia tusi mo le faaolataga o se lalolagi ua faaleagaina; ma e faapea afai e mafai e le afi ona faamū se laau mata mo le mamalu o le Atua, o le a faigofie lava ona susunuina o laau mamago e faamamā ai le tovine mai le faaleagaina. Sa soifua i laua mo le mamalu; sa maliliu i laua mo le mamalu; ma o le mamalu o lo laua taui lea e faavavau. E mai lea vaitausaga i lea vaitausaga o le a oo atu o laua igoa i lalo i tupulaga o ni maa taua i e ua faapaiaina.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"Hyrum","sm":"Ailama"},{"en":"Smith","sm":"Samita"},{"en":"that","sm":"na"},{"en":"forty","sm":"fasefulu-fa"},{"en":"years","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the elder","sm":"matua"},{"en":"to","sm":"ia"},{"en":"February,","sm":"Fepuari,"},{"en":"","sm":"1844,"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Joseph","sm":"Iosefa"},{"en":"Smith","sm":"Samita"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"","sm":"tolusefulu-valu"},{"en":"to","sm":"ia"},{"en":"December,","sm":"Tesema,"},{"en":"","sm":"1843;"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"from the time","sm":"taimi"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"agai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"the going forward","sm":"luma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"shall","sm":"a"},{"en":"written","sm":"tusia"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"},{"en":"them","sm":"laua"},{"en":"names","sm":"igoa"},{"en":"·","sm"